Austin Arnold Capstone
as of 5/5/2026

Directory:
New_framework - Contains the primary working code for the raspberry pi.
testing - used for spi tests
old - old stuff 
laptop_version - code from when I didn't have access to the pi but wanted to work


!!!New_framework!!!
build.sh: build script, should handle everything
axis.h: function headers, some global functions
frontend1.cpp: handles one of the coil sensors SPI and communication with DSP code
frontend2.cpp: same as above but second coil
transmit.cpp: sends vectors to esp32 and recieves frequency
calculator.py: particle filter that computes vector magnitude and direction from sensor data from coil 1 and 2.
signals.py: somewhat complete simulator program
dsp.cpp: handles lock in detection. Acts as a central server between all components.


Architecture:
						Transmit.cpp
							 |  ^
					freq	 |  | vectors
                     (1)     |  |   (3)
                             |  |
							\/  |
Frontend 1,  (data) --2/-> DSP.cpp 
               (1)           |  ^
                             |  |
							 |  |
						     |  |
          (processed data)   |  | vectors
                   (2)      \/  |   (3)
					     Calculator.py














